378
00:33:46.065 --> 00:33:47.650
Hindi ko alam kung paano niya ito nakayanan.

379
00:33:48.693 --> 00:33:50.486
Paano niya nakayanan ang lahat ng iyon?

380
00:33:54.532 --> 00:33:55.950
