So niligtas ka namin ni Dad?

383
00:34:07.545 --> 00:34:09.005
Ganap, ginawa mo.

384
00:34:10.339 --> 00:34:11.674
Niligtas mo kami.

385
00:34:17.555 --> 00:34:19.474
<i>Kung hindi dahil sa iyo...</i>

386
00:34:20.391 --> 00:34:21.934
<i>Kung hindi ikaw...</i>

387
00:34:23.269 --> 00:34:26.647
PANGALAN NG NAMATAY: YANG DONG-MYEONG

388
00:34:32.445 --> 00:34:36.240
HOUSEHOOLDER: YANG GWAN-SIK

389
00:34:37.992 --> 00:34:41.579
KAUGNAYAN SA SAMBAHAY: ANAK

